  "title": "United Fire Group, Inc. reports first quarter 2026 results",
  "summary": "First quarter net income of $1.15 per diluted share and adjusted operating income of $1.16 per diluted share First quarter 2026 highlights compared to first quarter 2025, unless otherwise noted: (1) Net income increased $12.4 million to $30.1 million. Net investment income increased 15% to $27.0 million. Combined ratio improved 3.8 points to 95.6%; composed of an underlying loss ratio of 57.0%, catastrophe loss ratio of 3.7%, no prior year reserve development, and underwriting expense ratio of 3",
